        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo lina lyawo tiliciŵa lyakupikanika mpaka ku ndaŵi syangamala, nipo ŵandu tacitiji, ‘AMBUJE Ŵamaciligosope ni Mlungu jwele juŵamlambilaga Aisalaeli.’ Nipo ucimwene wangu tiwucitamilicika mpaka ku ndaŵi syangamala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
