          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ligongo wawo ali Mlungu jwangu, nipo atesile cilanga kuti yisukulu yangu tiyiciŵa ayimwene. Ali ni ligongo lyakwe limbile mtima kuti mbopele lipopeloli kwa wawo mwamti myiyi, atamose kuti une ndili jwakutumicila jwawope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
