              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano ngwaŵenda wawo kuti ayipe upile yisukulu yangu nipo kuti tapitilisye kuŵa ayimwene ŵawo ŵakusagulidwa. Wawo AMBUJE, apelece kala upile kwa jemanjajo, nipo upile wawo tiwuciŵa pa jemanjaji mpaka ku ndaŵi syangamala.”",
